+**Added:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Changed:**
+
+* The forward and reverse convergence analysis now retains
+  and plots the free energy estimates at the fractions MBAR could evaluate,
+  instead of discarding the whole analysis, when MBAR fails to converge at low
+  fractions of uncorrelated samples. Individual MBAR failures are recorded as NaN.
+  PR #1984
+
+**Deprecated:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Removed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Fixed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Security:**
+
+* <news item>
